      "source": "// Direct self-recursion return inference (fib piece): the recursive\n// call sits before the RETURN whose expression feeds inference, so\n// the function is seeded Dyn and the fixpoint refines from there.\n// Own probe; fib.prg itself stays oracle-side only.\nfunction fact( n )\n   local r\n   if n < 2\n      r := 1\n   else\n      r := n * fact( n - 1 )\n   endif\nreturn r\nfunction main()\n   local i\n   for i := 1 to 6\n      ? fact( i )\n   next\nreturn nil\n",
